{"kind":"stack","id":"s-levers","title":"Levers, pulleys and gears: making work easier","theme":{"background":"#f4f1e8","foreground":"#1d2a33","font":"Georgia, serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-q","content":"A seesaw is an example of which simple machine?"},{"type":"image","picto":"cog"},{"type":"button","id":"c1-a","label":"A lever","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"A wheel","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-c","label":"A battery","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Lever"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"A bar that turns around a fixed point called a pivot. A small push on one end lifts a heavier load at the other end."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Which machine uses a grooved wheel and a rope to lift a heavy load more easily?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"A pulley","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"A ramp","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"A hammer","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"How many teeth must a small gear turn to make a larger gear turn once?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"More teeth than the small gear has","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Fewer teeth than the small gear has","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Exactly the same number","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"Gear"},{"type":"text","id":"c5-e","content":"A wheel with teeth that meshes with another gear. Turning one gear turns the other, and the size of the gears changes the force and speed."},{"type":"button","id":"c5-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-q","content":"Which simple machine would let you lift a heavy rock with the least effort?"},{"type":"image","picto":"star"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"A long lever with the pivot close to the rock","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"A short lever with the pivot far from the rock","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-c","label":"No machine, just pushing harder","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"You must move a heavy box up a ramp. Do you use a pulley or a lever?"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-a","label":"Use a pulley","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Use a lever","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"The pulley lifts the box smoothly. You feel the rope pull less than the box weighs."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-t","content":"You place a bar under the box and push down on one end. The box rises with much less effort."},{"type":"button","id":"c9-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"In a lever, where is the fixed point called?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"The pivot","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"The handle","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"The load","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"Well done: you know how levers, pulleys and gears help us."},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"Machines let a small force do big work. Keep looking for them around you at home and in school."}],"actions":[]}}
